Potential edge case issue: If `l.Size` is 0, then `End: l.Size - 1` would be `-1`, which is invalid for a chunk range. This could cause issues when downloading layers with 0 size. Please add a check or handle this edge case.

```suggestion
 		if l.Size == 0 {
 			// Handle zero-size layer
 			yield(chunksum{
 				URL:    fmt.Sprintf("%s://%s/v2/%s/%s/blobs/%s", scheme, n.Host(), n.Namespace(), n.Model(), l.Digest),
 				Chunk:  blob.Chunk{Start: 0, End: 0},
 				Digest: l.Digest,
 			}, nil)
 			return
 		}
 		cs := chunksum{
 			URL: fmt.Sprintf("%s://%s/v2/%s/%s/blobs/%s",
 				scheme,
 				n.Host(),
 				n.Namespace(),
 				n.Model(),
 				l.Digest,
 			),
 			Chunk:  blob.Chunk{Start: 0, End: l.Size - 1},
